## Reagent guidebook

entity-effect-guidebook-disease-relieve =
    { $chance ->
        [1] Relieves
        *[other] relieve
    } the symptoms of { $target } for { NATURALFIXED($time, 3) } { MANY("second", $time) } without affecting the disease itself
